---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';

const rawBase = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const base = rawBase.endsWith('/') ? rawBase : `${rawBase}/`;
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="About us — Nullpunkt Labs AG"
  description="Nullpunkt Labs AG, headquartered in Zug (Switzerland): a leader at the intersection of high-performance digital computing, photonic bio-resonance, and classical saccharose refinement."
  altDePath="ueber-uns/"
  altEnPath="en/about/"
>
  <Navbar lang="en" deHref={`${base}ueber-uns/`} enHref={`${base}en/about/`} />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20">
    <p data-reveal class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.35em] text-flux">
      NULLPUNKT LABS AG · ZUG (SWITZERLAND)
    </p>
    <h1
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
      class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl"
    >
      About us
    </h1>
    <blockquote
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay: 180ms"
      class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-flux/60 pl-4 text-lg italic text-muted"
    >
      “From the cradle of alpine vacuum quantum mechanics straight into your CPU cache.”
    </blockquote>

    <section data-reveal class="mt-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Who we are</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Nullpunkt Labs AG, headquartered in tax-optimized Zug (Switzerland), is a leading
        technology company at the intersection of high-performance digital computing,
        photonic bio-resonance, and classical saccharose refinement. Since our spin-off in
        2024, we have been developing enterprise-grade software architectures that pick up
        exactly where conventional physics leaves off.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        In a world where computing power dissipates in purely material fashion, we have made
        it our mission to transform the unused thermal resources of microprocessors into
        genuine quantum-homeopathic added value.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section data-reveal class="mt-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Our core competencies</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded border border-linec bg-surface p-5 shadow-card">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-flux">
            SUBATOMIC MONTE-CARLO SIMULATIONS
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Our proprietary algorithms compute vacuum fluctuations with a precision that
            makes even the most demanding Bach flower extract pale with envy.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded border border-linec bg-surface p-5 shadow-card">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-flux">
            CLINICAL RIGOR IN THE ENTERPRISE SEGMENT
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Every one of our software modules complies with strict, self-imposed ISO
            guidelines for contactless placebo transfer.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded border border-linec bg-surface p-5 shadow-card">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-flux">
            DECENTRALIZED BIO-FIELD INFRASTRUCTURE
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Through the consistent use of local hardware resources (including deliberate,
            audible full utilization of your CPU cores), we guarantee absolutely
            latency-free potentiation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-reveal class="mt-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Mission statement</h2>
      <blockquote
        class="mt-6 rounded border border-linec bg-inset/60 p-6 text-center font-mono text-sm tracking-wider text-ink"
      >
        “No cloud. No uploads. Just pure silicon and pure sugar.”
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        We believe in the sovereignty of the local data center. While international
        corporations store your data in opaque clouds, at Nullpunkt Labs your photonic
        reflections stay exactly where they belong: locally in the cache, until the fan
        glows.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section data-reveal class="mt-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
        Board &amp; Scientific Advisory Board
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded border border-linec bg-surface p-5 shadow-card">
          <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Dr. quant. h.c. Urs-Viktor Nullmatter</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest text-flux">CHIEF QUANTUM OFFICER</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Pioneer in the field of digital globule synthesis and former lead developer of
            high-end practice transparencies.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded border border-linec bg-surface p-5 shadow-card">
          <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Beatrix Läubli-Matter</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest text-flux">
            HEAD OF COMPLIANCE &amp; BIO-CHECK
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Responsible for the seamless verification of all DIN EN ISO 17025-compliant
            homeopathy half-cycles.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-faint">
        All persons named in this publication are entirely fictitious. Any
        resemblance to living or deceased persons would be purely coincidental
        and expressly unintended.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="mt-14 border-t border-linec pt-6 text-center font-mono text-[11px] text-faint">
      Nullpunkt Labs AG — Zug, Switzerland · All rights reserved. Photon streams never
      leave the device.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
